Typefaces
---------

Eight WOFF2 faces of three families are embedded directly in the design
specimen (design/identity/dezfil-identity.html): Gabarito at 500, 600 and
700, Inter at 400, 500 and 600, and DM Mono at 400 and 500. Five families
are self hosted at build time by the application itself
(src/app/layout.tsx): Archivo, DM Mono, Gabarito, IBM Plex Mono and Inter.
All eight files and all five families are licensed under the SIL Open Font
License, Version 1.1, whose text is reproduced at the end of this file.
