Shipped templates
-----------------

The templates the image carries (templates/) hold third-party data. Each
shipped version is listed with every source its data comes from, the
source's licence and the credit it asks for, as the template's own map
names them in its credit note. Templates a deployment downloads from a
catalogue are not part of a release and credit their sources in their
own maps.

- earthquakes version 3 ("Forty years of big earthquakes"):
  - U.S. Geological Survey, ANSS Comprehensive Earthquake Catalog (ComCat), CC-PDDC: Credit: U.S. Geological Survey
  - World tectonic plates and boundaries (PB2002), Peter Bird (2003), converted by Hugo Ahlenius, Nordpil, ODC-By-1.0: Hugo Ahlenius, Nordpil and Peter Bird
- air-routes version 3 ("The world's air routes"):
  - OpenFlights Airport and Route Databases, ODbL-1.0: OpenFlights.org
- rwanda-health-access version 3 ("Health access in Rwanda"):
  - Kontur Population: Rwanda, population density for 400m H3 hexagons, CC-BY-4.0: Kontur Population, Kontur Inc., via the Humanitarian Data Exchange
  - Public health facilities in sub-Saharan Africa, Maina et al. (2019), CC0-1.0: Snow RW, Maina J, Ouma PO, Macharia PM, Alegana VA, Mitto B, et al. (2019). Public health facilities in sub Saharan Africa. figshare. doi:10.6084/m9.figshare.7725374.v1
  - geoBoundaries Rwanda districts (ADM2), from Open Data Rwanda, CC-BY-4.0: geoBoundaries (www.geoboundaries.org), Runfola et al. (2020); boundaries from Open Data Rwanda

